<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Golf AI Coach</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Golf AI Coach — swing coaching at the intersection of data, AI and grass." />
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Cpath d='M9 3v26' stroke='%23fff' stroke-width='2.5'/%3E%3Cpath d='M10 4l14 5-14 5z' fill='%23e5483a'/%3E%3Cellipse cx='12' cy='29' rx='8' ry='2' fill='%23222'/%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
</head>
<body>
  <canvas id="scene" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div id="labels" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <header class="hud hud-left">
    <a class="logo" href="#top" aria-label="Golf AI Coach home">GOLF<span class="flag" aria-hidden="true"></span>AI</a>
    <p class="mono">// Copyright © 2026</p>
    <p class="mono">Golf AI Coach, Inc.<br />All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </header>

  <aside class="hud hud-right">
    <p class="mono">////// Manifesto</p>
    <p class="mono manifesto">Our mission is to build the next generation of swing coaching at the intersection of Data, AI, and freshly cut grass.</p>
  </aside>

  <footer class="hud hud-bottom">
    <p class="mono">Scroll down to<br />discover.</p>
    <button id="sound" class="mono sound" type="button" aria-pressed="false">
      <svg width="16" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 5h3l4-3v10L4 9H1z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><path class="x" d="M10.5 4.5l4 5m0-5l-4 5" stroke="currentColor"/><path class="w" d="M10.5 4.5q2 2.5 0 5M12.5 2.5q4 4.5 0 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></svg>
      <span>Sound: <b>Off</b></span>
    </button>
  </footer>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="intro"></section>
    <section class="chapter right">
      <div class="panel mono">
        <p class="kicker">////// 01 — Swing Lab</p>
        <h2>Lorem tee ipsum.</h2>
        <p>Dolor sit fairway, consectetur birdie elit. Sed do eagle tempor incididunt ut divot et dolore magna grip. Ut enim ad minim backswing.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="chapter left">
      <div class="panel mono">
        <p class="kicker">////// 02 — Green Reader</p>
        <h2>Putta slopus maxima.</h2>
        <p>Quis nostrud bunker ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo chippa. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in velvet greens.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="chapter right">
      <div class="panel mono">
        <p class="kicker">////// 03 — Caddie AI</p>
        <h2>Holus in unum.</h2>
        <p>Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia mulligan. Lorem ipsum flagstick, sed nine iron amet.</p>
        <a class="cta" href="https://golf-ai-coach-alpha.vercel.app/">Open the coach →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script type="module" src="/src/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
EOF
cat > src/style.css <<'EOF'
:root {
  --bg: #a0a5b1;
  --ink: #ffffff;
  --accent: #e5483a;
  --pad: clamp(24px, 6.5vw, 50px);
  --mono: "Space Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
  --display: "Unbounded", system-ui, sans-serif;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; }
html, body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); overflow-x: hidden; }
body { font-family: var(--mono); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
#scene { position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
#labels { position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; }
.tag { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; font: 400 11px/1 var(--mono); color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,.35); white-space: nowrap; }
.tag::before { content: "+"; position: absolute; left: -4px; top: 6px; font-size: 13px; }

.mono { font: 400 12px/1.32 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .01em; text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(40,50,40,.25); }
.hud { position: fixed; z-index: 2; animation: fade 1.2s .2s both; }
.hud-left { top: var(--pad); left: var(--pad); }
.hud-left .mono { margin-top: 18px; }
.hud-left .mono + .mono { margin-top: 16px; }
.logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: flex-start; font: 800 clamp(28px, 5.7vw, 56px)/0.8 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.03em; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; }
.logo .flag { width: .3em; height: .8em; margin: 0 .1em 0 .12em; border-left: .07em solid currentColor; position: relative; }
.logo .flag::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; border-left: .26em solid var(--accent); border-top: .14em solid transparent; border-bottom: .14em solid transparent; }
.hud-right { top: calc(var(--pad) + 6px); right: var(--pad); text-align: right; }
.hud-right .manifesto { margin-top: 15px; width: 13.2em; margin-left: auto; }
.hud-bottom { left: var(--pad); bottom: var(--pad); }
.sound { margin-top: 26px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: none; border: 0; padding: 0; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
.sound b { font-weight: 400; }
.sound .w { display: none; }
.sound[aria-pressed="true"] .w { display: inline; }
.sound[aria-pressed="true"] .x { display: none; }

main { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
section { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 var(--pad); }
.intro { min-height: 100vh; }
.chapter.right { justify-content: flex-end; }
.panel { max-width: 340px; padding: 22px 24px; background: rgba(30, 40, 32, .28); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35); }
.panel .kicker { opacity: .85; }
.panel h2 { font: 800 26px/1.05 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.02em; margin: 14px 0 12px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.panel p:not(.kicker) { line-height: 1.5; }
.cta { display: inline-block; margin-top: 18px; padding: 10px 14px; border: 1px solid #fff; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font: inherit; transition: background .2s, color .2s; }
.cta:hover, .cta:focus-visible { background: #fff; color: #233024; }

@keyframes fade { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }

@media (max-width: 500px) {
  .mono { font-size: 11px; }
  .hud-right .manifesto { width: 12em; }
  .panel { max-width: 100%; }
  .panel h2 { font-size: 21px; }
  section { align-items: flex-end; padding-bottom: 140px; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .hud { animation: none; } }
EOF

